{"3010150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BLOODY HELL 2", "steam_appid": 3010150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Being Shameless :))</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/8cdcdd940ec1a7b907817a8b0b1fea69.avif?t=1788169271\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras_big/8cdcdd940ec1a7b907817a8b0b1fea69.webp?t=1788169271 width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/e98c672664eabb0647397b15e5ea5668.avif?t=1788169271\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras_big/e98c672664eabb0647397b15e5ea5668.webp?t=1788169271 width=1560 height=274 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Steam changed it so we can no longer have embedded links :(( ... so you'll have to find the link to the discord on this page yourself, I know... what a struggle.</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                      <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/1532a6c8b5d51ef748f5d26194167c3c.webp?t=1788169271\" width=620 height=63 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/49ffd27fbb63889ea8e45d9100af3ff8.poster.avif?t=1788169271\" width=780 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/49ffd27fbb63889ea8e45d9100af3ff8.webm?t=1788169271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/49ffd27fbb63889ea8e45d9100af3ff8.mp4?t=1788169271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Take control of a small angel wielding a giant demonic hammer, and explore 7 of hell's bizarre and twisted layers intertwined with the fallen remains of Heaven.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Discover hidden upgrades and abilities to sate your hunger for power and find Map fragments to chart your way through the inferno.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/6d612ac34dc2425b4c7d595d22b1e978.avif?t=1788169271\" width=620 height=93 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/f6345ed3a37444a979fff1e12975f727.poster.avif?t=1788169271\" width=780 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/f6345ed3a37444a979fff1e12975f727.webm?t=1788169271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/f6345ed3a37444a979fff1e12975f727.mp4?t=1788169271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Paint the walls red using demons as ammunition and launch them into one another using your giant demonic hammer. Then consume their blood and use it as your own to unleash a devastating ultimate attack!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Restore power to your Holy Halo and use it to defeat large demonic bosses and other massive monstrosities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                     <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/f78f521a10c29012252c8bb8ca0a9a4c.avif?t=1788169271\" width=620 height=93 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/9e8d797796b76a580baa1650ac42b221.poster.avif?t=1788169271\" width=780 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/9e8d797796b76a580baa1650ac42b221.webm?t=1788169271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/9e8d797796b76a580baa1650ac42b221.mp4?t=1788169271\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">God has disappeared, the sky has fallen, and angels are in distress. Strike deals with powers unknown and claim even more by finding slumbering powers of another. Discover who is truly in charge of the world, and what is keeping the world from falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                    <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/6af36dc9541365d9965fe2ad5c875164.avif?t=1788169271\" width=620 height=93 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/729d5e28587a1bbe777965e23440fb1e.poster.avif?t=1788169271\" width=780 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras/729d5e28587a1bbe777965e23440fb1e.webm?t=1788169271\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010150/extras